OL,3,GNEWSAStories to make you smile from
OL,4,Aacross the West Midlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the headlines are often filled
OL,7,Fwith more serious stories, there are
OL,8,Fstill plenty of positive and happier
OL,9,Fmoments happening across the West
OL,10,FMidlands - and we want to celebrate and
OL,11,Fshare them.
OL,13,FThis week, we have heard how a sprinter
OL,14,Fbecame mayor for a day, how a Channel
OL,15,Fswim was fuelled by cake and tinned
OL,16,Fpeaches and how a married couple both
OL,17,Fbecame world champion pole climbers.
OL,19,FHere is a look at some of those news
OL,20,Fstories from across the region:
